     bottom); capability: a 50 Ohm 50 W load, an RF power meter, a DC supply with current reading; owner: the supplier's bench (unsent)
   B-PA2 (physical, confirms the loop): the cap's current at the three frequencies and both flange temperatures, inside 6.438 to 7.012 A;
     the key-up transient on a scope (the loop's settling, the PA rail inside U13's regulation), with the VGG capture gen_sch_d.py owes
   U5 (the rest voltage's fall during the 60 s, R-214) stays MISSING; the case at the cap has 0.298 V of margin against it

